<svg viewBox="0 0 1600 900" version="1.1" preserveAspectRatio="xMinYMin meet" text-rendering="geometricPrecision" class="p8" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"><defs><style type="text/css">text{white-space:pre;font-size:16px;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;fill:none;unicode-bidi:bidi-override}@font-face{font-family:"p8_g_d0_f1";src:url("data:application/font-woff;charset=utf-8;base64,") format("woff");}@font-face{font-family:"p8_g_d0_f3";src:url("data:application/font-woff;charset=utf-8;base64,") format("woff");}.p8 .ff1{font-family:"p8_g_d0_f3",sans-serif;line-height:1}.p8 .ff2{font-family:"p8_g_d0_f1",sans-serif;line-height:1}.p8 .fs2{font-size:17.333334px}.p8 .fc1{fill:#000000}.p8 .fc2{fill:#fa4a18}.p8 .fc3{fill:#555555}.p8 .sc1{stroke:none}</style></defs><image width="1600" height="900" preserveAspectRatio="none" xlink:href="data:image/jpeg;base64,"></image><text class="ff1 fc1" transform="matrix(1.67 0 0 1.67 899.43 110.64)" textLength="376.35">3. Usar cierres resistentes al fuego y un acceso a </text><text class="ff1 fc1" transform="matrix(1.67 0 0 1.67 899.43 142.31)" textLength="171.97">las puertas despejado</text><text class="ff1 fc1" transform="matrix(1.67 0 0 1.67 899.43 205.64)" textLength="311.46">4. Disponer de una instalación eléctrica </text><text class="ff1 fc1" transform="matrix(1.67 0 0 1.67 899.43 237.31)" textLength="101.10">antiexplosiva</text><text class="ff1 fc1" transform="matrix(1.67 0 0 1.67 899.43 300.64)" textLength="313.79">5. Contar con medidas contra incendios</text><text class="ff1 fc1" transform="matrix(1.67 0 0 1.67 899.43 363.97)" textLength="339.34">6. Tener sistemas de drenaje para controlar </text><text class="ff1 fc1" transform="matrix(1.67 0 0 1.67 899.43 395.64)" textLength="67.25">derrame</text><text class="ff1 fc1" transform="matrix(1.67 0 0 1.67 899.43 458.97)" textLength="338.45">7. Además, en zonas donde se almacenan </text><text class="ff1 fc1" transform="matrix(1.67 0 0 1.67 899.43 490.64)" textLength="372.06">productos peligrosos, no es recomendable que </text><text class="ff1 fc1" transform="matrix(1.67 0 0 1.67 899.43 522.31)" textLength="380.82">se realicen labores que puedan producir calor o </text><text class="ff1 fc1" transform="matrix(1.67 0 0 1.67 899.43 553.97)" textLength="170.99">chispas (como soldar)</text><text class="ff1 fc1" transform="matrix(1.67 0 0 1.67 181.09 157.71)" textLength="333.30">A continuación te damos los consejos que </text><text class="ff1 fc1" transform="matrix(1.67 0 0 1.67 181.09 189.38)" textLength="72.80">necesitas</text><text class="ff2 fc1" transform="matrix(1.67 0 0 1.67 302.56 189.38)" textLength="263.15"> para que el almacenamiento de </text><text class="ff2 fc1" transform="matrix(1.67 0 0 1.67 181.09 221.05)" textLength="153.15">productos químicos</text><text class="ff1 fc1" transform="matrix(1.67 0 0 1.67 436.56 221.05)" textLength="196.72"> de tu fábrica sea el más </text><text class="ff1 fc1" transform="matrix(1.67 0 0 1.67 181.09 252.71)" textLength="335.15">óptimo y puedas prevenir los 5 factores de </text><text class="ff1 fc1" transform="matrix(1.67 0 0 1.67 181.09 284.38)" textLength="50.22">riesgo.</text><text class="ff1 fc1" transform="matrix(1.67 0 0 1.67 181.09 342.71)" textLength="301.58">Acondiciona tus instalaciones para un </text><text class="ff1 fc1" transform="matrix(1.67 0 0 1.67 181.09 374.38)" textLength="359.47">almacenamiento de productos químicos más </text><text class="ff1 fc1" transform="matrix(1.67 0 0 1.67 181.09 406.05)" textLength="52.32">seguro</text><text class="ff1 fc1" transform="matrix(1.67 0 0 1.67 181.09 464.38)" textLength="312.90">Para garantizar un almacenamiento de </text><text class="ff1 fc1" transform="matrix(1.67 0 0 1.67 181.09 496.05)" textLength="369.71">sustancias peligrosas correcto, las instalaciones </text><text class="ff1 fc1" transform="matrix(1.67 0 0 1.67 181.09 527.71)" textLength="160.69">del almacén deben:</text><text class="ff1 fc1" transform="matrix(1.67 0 0 1.67 181.09 586.05)" textLength="377.65">1. Disponer una buena ventilación, sobre todo si </text><text class="ff1 fc1" transform="matrix(1.67 0 0 1.67 181.09 617.71)" textLength="112.53">se trata de un </text><text class="ff1 fc1" transform="matrix(1.67 0 0 1.67 622.70 617.71)" textLength="47.82">y si se </text><text class="ff1 fc1" transform="matrix(1.67 0 0 1.67 181.09 649.38)" textLength="373.78">almacenan productos inflamables o tóxicos, ya </text><text class="ff1 fc1" transform="matrix(1.67 0 0 1.67 181.09 681.05)" textLength="342.18">que pueden crear una atmósfera explosiva.</text><text class="ff1 fc1" transform="matrix(1.67 0 0 1.67 181.09 739.38)" textLength="180.69">2. Evitar focos de calor </text></svg>